13. DECORATOR VS ADAPTER
---------------------------------------------------------

Decorator

Purpose:
Add functionality.

Focus:
Behavior Extension

Memory Trick:

Decorator = Feature Adder

--------------------------------------------

Adapter

Purpose:
Convert one interface into another.

Focus:
Interface Conversion

Memory Trick:

